(PART A — INSTRUCTIONS TO BIDDERS) Tj T*
(1. Conditional bids will be summarily rejected.) Tj T*
(2. The bidder shall upload scanned copies of GST registration, PAN and audited) Tj T*
(balance sheets.) Tj T*
(3. Bidders shall have completed at least one similar work of value not less than) Tj T*
(40 % of the estimated cost during the last seven years.) Tj T*
(4. The bidder shall submit the EMD in the form of online payment or bank) Tj T*
(guarantee from a scheduled bank.) Tj T*
(5. The bidder must be registered with the Department in the appropriate class.) Tj T*
(6. The bid shall remain valid for 90 days from the date of opening of the) Tj T*
(technical bid.) Tj T*
(7. The successful bidder shall furnish a performance guarantee of 5 % of the) Tj T*
(contract value within 15 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(COMMERCIAL TERMS AND CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(1. All disputes shall be subject to arbitration under the Arbitration and) Tj T*
(Conciliation Act, 1996.) Tj T*
(2. The contractor shall indemnify the Department against all claims arising out) Tj T*
