(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers construction of rcc elevated service reservoir) Tj T*
(complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(i\) Exposure condition for the design of the structure shall be taken as severe) Tj T*
(in terms of IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(i\) Plain and reinforced cement concrete works shall comply with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(ii\) Grade of concrete for all RCC members shall be M30. The nominal cover to) Tj T*
(reinforcement shall be 45 millimetre.) Tj T*
(iii\) Maximum free water-cement ratio shall be 0.55.) Tj T*
(iv\) Cement content shall be not less than 320 kg/cu.m.) Tj T*
(v\) OPC 43 grade cement complying with IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(vi\) Aggregates, both coarse and fine, shall comply with IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(vii\) Fe 500D TMT reinforcement bars complying with IS 1786:1985 shall be used.) Tj T*
(Mix proportioning of concrete shall be done as per IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(viii\) Concrete shall be cured for not less than 10 days.) Tj T*
(ix\) Mechanical needle vibrators shall be used for compaction of concrete.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
